id: sl_si91x_mcu_secure_storage
label: MCU Secure Storage
package: platform_siwx91x
description: >
  Secure Storage is a Si91x MCU peripheral that provides non-volatile storage
  for sensitive data (keys, credentials). It supports write protection through a write key.
  Configurable parameters (through app config component):
    - Write key enable/disable
  Use with config/sl_si91x_secure_storage_config.h for UC screen and config header.
category: Device|Si91x|MCU|Service
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
root_path: "components/device/silabs/si91x/mcu/drivers/service/secure_storage"
config_file:
  - path: config/sl_si91x_secure_storage_config.h
    file_id: sl_si91x_secure_storage_config
source:
  - path: "src/sl_si91x_secure_storage.c"
include:
  - path: "inc"
    file_list:
      - path: "sl_si91x_secure_storage.h"
provides:
  - name: sl_si91x_mcu_secure_storage
requires:
  - name: status
  - name: log_none
